# The compositor is Huginn's own (54-huginn-compositor.list), for the desktop and for the sign-in screen alike, and
# so is the sign-in service (apps/huginn_signind.py): KWin, Plasma and SDDM are not in the image.
xwayland
# The desktop portal: Huginn's own answers apps' questions (huginn-portals.conf); GTK's answers what's left
# (printing, email, your name and picture). KDE's is gone.
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
xdg-user-dirs
# Qt apps that aren't Huginn's: their style (Kvantum, below), icons and fonts, and Open and Save through the portal
# (Huginn's own), from qt6ct's settings (huginn_look.py writes them; QT_QPA_PLATFORMTHEME=qt6ct). KDE's
# integration (plasma-integration) is gone.
qt6ct
qt6-xdgdesktopportal-platformtheme
# Location for Weather and Maps (the Privacy settings), screen makers' names in Displays.
geoclue-2.0
hwdata
# Shell services. Notifications, power, the hardware keys, Wi‑Fi passwords and Bluetooth pairing are Huginn's own
# session daemon (apps/huginn_sessiond.py); Plasma's (plasma-nm, plasma-pa, powerdevil, bluedevil) are not-wanted.
libnotify-bin
wireplumber
bluez
upower
# Theming: Qt apps in a Kvantum style generated from Huginn's tokens (Kvantum isn't KDE's; KvAdapta's drawing, from
# its themes, is what's recoloured); GTK 3 apps in Huginn's own theme (/usr/share/themes/Huginn: Adwaita's shapes,
# which GTK carries, in the realm's colours). KDE's Breeze style and Breeze-GTK are gone.
qt6-style-kvantum
qt-style-kvantum-themes
# Icons: Huginn's own theme (scripts/make-icons.py, in the overlay), with Breeze's underneath for anything it doesn't
# draw; and Breeze's pointers (Settings › Appearance offers Huginn's own and others). Artwork, kept as it is.
breeze-icon-theme
breeze-cursor-theme
fonts-inter-variable
fonts-jetbrains-mono
fonts-noto-core
fonts-noto-color-emoji
# Japanese, Chinese and Korean text (without it web pages and file names in them show as boxes)
fonts-noto-cjk
# Native apps (deliberately few)
udisks2
ffmpeg
gvfs-backends
gvfs-fuse
avahi-utils
# App delivery (no snapd): Flatpak, driven by the Huginn App Store
flatpak
# Huginn runtime (Phase 2 replaces this with the huginn .deb)
python3
python3-pyqt6
python3-pyqt6.qtwebengine
# Installer
# Huginn's password prompt (apps/huginn_polkit.py) speaks to polkit through its own GObject bindings
gir1.2-polkit-1.0
pkexec
